     "id": "P020_B",
     "language": "en",
     "text": "RIVERSIDE COMMUNITY HOSPITAL\nMedical Outpatient Clinic\n\nPatient: Laurena Heidenreich\nHospital ID: P020\nDate of birth: 21 January 1960\nDate of visit: 5 September 2021\n\nDear Doctor,\n\nI reviewed this 61-year-old woman in the medical clinic today. Her background includes miscarriage in first trimester. She is known to have recurrent urinary tract infection. She is known to have hyperlipidemia.\n\nShe has no known allergies.\n\nShe continues on simvastatin 5 mg at night.\n\nPlan: no changes today. Review in clinic in three months.\n\nYours sincerely,\nMedical Outpatient Clinic\n"
    },
    {
     "id": "P020_C",
     "language": "en",
     "text": "========================================================\n SERI BAYU MEDICAL CENTRE\n MEDICATION RECONCILIATION SHEET\n========================================================\n Name    : LAURENA HEIDENREICH\n ID      : P020\n DOB     : 21-Jan-1960    Sex: F\n Date    : 01-Nov-2021\n========================================================\n\n[ALLERGIES]\n  - NKA\n\n[PROBLEM LIST]\n  - Miscarriage in first trimester\n  - Recurrent urinary tract infection\n  - Hyperlipidemia\n\n[CURRENT MEDICATIONS]\n  1. Zocor 10 mg ON\n\n========================================================\n Reconciled by: Pharmacy, Seri Bayu Medical Centre\n========================================================\n"
